{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus datasource for Confluent Cloud metrics or JMX exporter metrics",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "FSI Kafka Platform",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "FSI Kafka Platform - DR Readiness monitoring. Mirror lag per topic with SLA-tier threshold visualization, cluster link health, and failover readiness assessment.",
  "editable": true,
  "gnetId": null,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Overall DR Health",
      "description": "Worst-case mirror lag assessment across all monitored topics. Green = all within SLA, Yellow = some exceed warn, Red = some exceed alert threshold.",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(confluent_kafka_server_cluster_link_mirror_topic_offset_lag{kafka_id=\"$CLUSTER_ID\", topic=~\"$DOMAIN_PREFIX.*\"} / on(topic) rate(confluent_kafka_server_received_records{kafka_id=\"$CLUSTER_ID\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Worst Mirror Lag (seconds)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#22C55E", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB308", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "#EF4444", "value": 60 }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 120,
          "noValue": "No data available. Verify metrics export is configured and the target cluster is reachable."
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "showThresholdLabels": true,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Mirror Lag Per Topic (Seconds)",
      "description": "Mirror lag time series per topic. Threshold lines show SLA-tier warn (yellow) and alert (red) levels. Mirror lag thresholds from ADR-008: critical warn=30s/alert=60s, standard warn=300s/alert=900s, best-effort warn=3600s/alert=14400s, compliance warn=10s/alert=30s.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "confluent_kafka_server_cluster_link_mirror_topic_offset_lag{kafka_id=\"$CLUSTER_ID\", topic=~\"$DOMAIN_PREFIX.*\"} / on(topic) rate(confluent_kafka_server_received_records{kafka_id=\"$CLUSTER_ID\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line+area" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#22C55E", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB308", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "#EF4444", "value": 60 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*mirror.*" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82F6" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Per-Topic DR Assessment",
      "description": "Per-topic mirror lag with SLA tier classification, lag assessment (OK/WARN/ALERT), and primary/mirror topic names.",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "confluent_kafka_server_cluster_link_mirror_topic_offset_lag{kafka_id=\"$CLUSTER_ID\", topic=~\"$DOMAIN_PREFIX.*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Assessment" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.displayMode",
                "value": "color-background"
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "OK": { "color": "#22C55E", "text": "OK" } } },
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "WARN": { "color": "#EAB308", "text": "WARN" } } },
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "ALERT": { "color": "#EF4444", "text": "ALERT" } } }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Mirror Topic" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82F6" } },
              { "id": "custom.displayMode", "value": "color-text" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Lag (records)", "desc": true }]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "instance": true, "job": true, "kafka_id": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "topic": "Primary Topic",
              "mirror_topic": "Mirror Topic",
              "sla_tier": "SLA Tier",
              "Value": "Lag (records)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Topics Exceeding Alert Threshold",
      "description": "Count of topics where mirror lag exceeds the alert threshold for their SLA tier.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(confluent_kafka_server_cluster_link_mirror_topic_offset_lag{kafka_id=\"$CLUSTER_ID\", topic=~\"$DOMAIN_PREFIX.*\"} / on(topic) rate(confluent_kafka_server_received_records{kafka_id=\"$CLUSTER_ID\"}[5m]) > 60)",
          "legendFormat": "Topics Over Alert",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#22C55E", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EF4444", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "SLA Tier Mirror Lag Thresholds",
      "description": "Reference table: mirror lag thresholds per SLA tier from ADR-008.",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 20 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Mirror Lag Thresholds by SLA Tier (ADR-008)\n\n| SLA Tier | Warn Threshold | Alert Threshold | DR Priority |\n|----------|---------------|-----------------|-------------|\n| **critical** | 30 seconds | 60 seconds | P1 - immediate |\n| **standard** | 5 minutes (300s) | 15 minutes (900s) | P2 - business hours |\n| **best-effort** | 1 hour (3600s) | 4 hours (14400s) | P3 - next business day |\n| **compliance** | 10 seconds | 30 seconds | P1 - immediate |\n\nThe gauge and threshold lines above use **critical** tier values by default. Use the SLA_TIER variable to filter topics by tier and adjust thresholds accordingly."
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["fsi-kafka", "dr-readiness", "observability"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "CLUSTER_ID",
        "label": "Cluster ID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "" },
        "options": [],
        "description": "Target Kafka cluster ID"
      },
      {
        "name": "DOMAIN_PREFIX",
        "label": "Domain",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "*" },
        "options": [],
        "description": "Topic domain filter pattern for auto-discovery"
      },
      {
        "name": "ENVIRONMENT",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "prod" },
        "options": [],
        "description": "Environment label"
      },
      {
        "name": "SLA_TIER",
        "label": "SLA Tier",
        "type": "custom",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": { "value": ["critical", "standard", "best-effort", "compliance"] },
        "options": [
          { "text": "critical", "value": "critical", "selected": true },
          { "text": "standard", "value": "standard", "selected": true },
          { "text": "best-effort", "value": "best-effort", "selected": true },
          { "text": "compliance", "value": "compliance", "selected": true }
        ],
        "description": "Filter by SLA tier to see tier-specific thresholds"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "FSI Kafka - DR Readiness",
  "uid": "fsi-kafka-dr-readiness",
  "version": 1
}
